# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the nightly sanitizers workflow (sanitizers.yml). Kept empty:
# a data race in porto-core or porto-io is a bug to fix, not to hide. An entry needs a comment
# above it saying which race it silences, why it is benign or foreign, and the bead that removes
# it, for example:
#   # Foreign: <library> reads <x> racily by design (porto-xxx).
#   race:<library>::<function>
